[{"text": "你特么去看礼红章，对方整府几个意思？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.6, "conflict": 0.5, "attack": 0.2}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "肯定是在德土耳其", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.7, "political": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你都蚌埠住了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "哈哈哈哈哈", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "好了，这下德国国旗也记住了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "阴湿德国人", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.9, "political": 0.4, "inflammatory": 0.3}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "同志们好", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.5, "humor": 0.4}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "哈哈哈哈哈小日本快申遗", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.8, "humor": 0.5, "political": 0.4}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "666", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "哈哈哈哈哈我笑一会儿", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.8, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你好歹先让大家知道原贴是什么吧 ？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.3, "conflict": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这特么到底是在说啥呢", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "怎么老艺术家还绷不住了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "5", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这下好了我能记住的国旗数量从2种变成3种了哈哈哈哈哈哈", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "现在都是ai出的吗", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.3, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原贴是啥？你们都不看截图是啥吗？动物园的下面不就是原贴吗？饭要喂到嘴巴里面？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.7, "conflict": 0.6, "information": 0.5}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "1", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "3", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "真的是 外面真的是群魔乱舞 瘴气弥漫", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.4}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原帖不是一开始就有吗？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5, "conflict": 0.2}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "欧洲高通胀，高收入高物价，可支配收入低，最重要的是欧洲没法蔬菜水果自由，而且在外上厕所还要收费，外加没空调吹，鬼才愿意在欧洲生活呢", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.7, "political": 0.5}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "弹幕上要求说清事情始末都是跳着看视频的吗？你的发言让我感觉你和土耳其人共用一个大脑", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.8, "conflict": 0.7, "political": 0.3}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "没毛病，除了中国人，其他国家的基本都是动物", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.9, "political": 0.8, "inflammatory": 0.7}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "除了中国人，其他国家哪里有人性", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.9, "political": 0.8, "inflammatory": 0.7}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "2", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "哈哈哈哈", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.9}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "文明观猴", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.7, "humor": 0.5, "inflammatory": 0.3}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "原贴开始不是放了吗？看不见眼睛就捐了吧？反正也没啥用了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.8, "conflict": 0.6, "information": 0.4}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "除了中国，其他国家都用美国软件，平台，手机上网，还世界网络，就是一群动物园", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.8, "attack": 0.6, "inflammatory": 0.5}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "依旧解构天才。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5, "humor": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这里遮住的字是什么啊？大可大大方方发，成年人才大多见证，不会随便被西方叙事欠着鼻子走。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.7, "information": 0.4}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "蛮夷禽兽也，畏威而不怀德", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"attack": 0.8, "political": 0.7, "inflammatory": 0.6}, "dominant": "attack", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "瞬间对德国国旗有记忆点了哈哈哈哈", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我本以为我是花钱上厕所，没想到吃了一坨大的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "现实里能想到建长城的国家，怎么可能到网络世界，就不“建墙”了，这能和自由扯到一起，那不如把自由和安全辩证统一一下", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.9, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.9, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "谢谢，终于记住了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.4, "humor": 0.3}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "出去过之后发现有墙真好", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.8, "emotional_resonance": 0.4}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "转人工", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "在国内是个十分普通的阴阳……扔国外就炸了？老外水平是不是太……", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.5, "humor": 0.3}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "派大星跳伞，让我记住了土耳其国旗！现在，蜡笔小新让我记住了德国国旗。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.8, "information": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "我们建网只是建了个能抵挡墙外丧尸的门，中国以内是我家，我想出门冒险了，就开网出去走走，待久了，就会想家", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.8, "emotional_resonance": 0.5, "humor": 0.2}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "但凡在x上看过出生乱舞，都会赞一句墙还是有好处的。。。", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.8, "attack": 0.4, "inflammatory": 0.3}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "梯子不是违法的，动物园门票违法嘛", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "political": 0.4}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "ou", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"irrelevant_repetition": 0.8}, "dominant": "irrelevant_repetition", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "天才", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "你确定是德国人而不是德国IP的土耳其人？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5, "political": 0.3}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "高速移动的小新", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "这个无法反驳", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "丸辣，我将如何直视蜡笔小新", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "的确挺MEAN的", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "先不提物价啥的，就治安这一块还是中国好，赚再多被偷了抢甚至噶了那不炸了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.7, "information": 0.3, "emotional_resonance": 0.2}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "神评", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "一个遵循本地法律法规的遮挡，就变成不“大大方方”了？ 你独立思考的能力呢？到底哪一种才是会被牵着鼻子走的人？", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"conflict": 0.8, "political": 0.5, "attack": 0.3}, "dominant": "conflict", "score": 0.8, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "中国人可以回家，他们不能", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.7, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "笑场了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.5}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "太有才了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"emotional_resonance": 0.6}, "dominant": "emotional_resonance", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "没绷住", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.6, "emotional_resonance": 0.3}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.6, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "以前的话欧洲确实不错，这两年算了，太不稳定了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"political": 0.5, "information": 0.3}, "dominant": "political", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "也就说大家默认公共厕所免费呗", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.4}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "猩猩色色", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "irrelevant_repetition": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "好家伙这语音不是ai呀", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.5}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "就简单说就是他问中国人，为什么还要专门花钱买梯子去外网看他们吐槽自己国家", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"information": 0.7, "political": 0.4}, "dominant": "information", "score": 0.7, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "见证物种的多样性", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.5, "attack": 0.4, "inflammatory": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.5, "source": "llm-llm"}, {"text": "不是怎么外网也开始闹鱼灾了", "time_ms": 0, "mode": 1, "tags": {"humor": 0.4, "political": 0.2}, "dominant": "humor", "score": 0.4, "source": "llm-llm"}]